I've successfully completed a documentation improvement focused on **agent role identifier consistency**. The issue was that while the actual role identifier in the code is `data_engineer` (with underscore), some documentation showed "Data Engineer" (with space) which could cause confusion for users trying to reference the agent in commands or configuration.

